    FEAT-0002: add volume buttons to the State version
    
    The phone gets volume up and volume down buttons. They do nothing while
    the phone is off, and change the volume between 0 and 10 while it is
    locked or ready.
    
    A new button is a new event, so every part of the pattern changed:
    PhoneState declares two new methods, OffState, LockedState and
    ReadyState each implement both, and Phone forwards both to its state.
    Phone also holds the volume, so the states change it through
    changeVolume().
    
    The State version is open to new states (see FEAT-0001), not new events.
    The switch version is the other way round.

